  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Diagnostic cost per sample reported by Cates et al. (2022), broken down into labour, equipment, reagents and consumables, training, maintenance and total (2021 USD), for three testing scenarios: All culture+, plust pDST (); All culture+ excluding Xpert/RIF-, plus pDST (); N/A (Diagnostic Comparitor (pDST)).",
